sequenceDiagram
    actor A as Admin
    participant B as Browser (React)
    participant S as Server (Express)
    participant DB as MySQL Database

    A->>B: Buka halaman User Management
    B->>S: GET /api/auth/users
    S->>S: Middleware auth & adminOnly
    S->>DB: SELECT * FROM users (exclude password)
    DB-->>S: Daftar users
    S-->>B: Response users[]
    B-->>A: Tampilkan daftar user

    Note over A,DB: Tambah User Baru

    A->>B: Isi form & tekan "Simpan"
    B->>S: POST /api/auth/users {nama, username, password, role}

    S->>DB: SELECT * FROM users WHERE username = ?
    DB-->>S: null (username tersedia)

    S->>S: hashedPassword = bcrypt.hash(password, 10)
    S->>DB: INSERT INTO users (nama, username, password, role)
    DB-->>S: User created

    S-->>B: Response 201 {user: {id, nama, username, role}}
    B-->>A: Tampilkan notifikasi & refresh list

    Note over A,DB: Hapus User

    A->>B: Klik "Hapus" pada user
    B->>S: DELETE /api/auth/users/{id}

    alt id = current admin id
        S-->>B: Response 400 "Tidak bisa menghapus akun sendiri"
        B-->>A: Tampilkan error
    else id ≠ current admin id
        S->>DB: SELECT * FROM users WHERE id = ?
        S->>DB: DELETE FROM users WHERE id = ?
        S-->>B: Response {message: "User berhasil dihapus"}
        B-->>A: Refresh daftar user
    end